    <string name="section_how_it_works">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_it_works_body">1. You close the flap: the light level collapses.\n2. FlipLock checks that the drop is fast, deep and sustained (%1$d ms).\n3. The screen locks.\n\nA room dimming gradually, or a hand passing over the phone, will not trigger a lock.</string>

