    <string name="tech_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="tech_privacy_body">FlipLock declares no Internet, camera, microphone, contacts, SMS, phone, location, files, accounts or Bluetooth permission.\n\nNo analytics, no Firebase, no telemetry, no server. Readings and logs stay in memory on the device and can be cleared at any time. Android cloud backup is disabled.</string>
